# Required --dart-define arguments for flutter run / flutter build.
# Copy this file's contents into your CI environment or pass directly:
#
#   flutter run \
#     --dart-define=SUPABASE_URL=https://xxxxxxxxxxxx.supabase.co \
#     --dart-define=SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJ... \
#     --dart-define=API_BASE_URL=https://da2-one.vercel.app
#
# For local development:
#   SUPABASE_URL    → supabase status → api.url (e.g. http://127.0.0.1:54321)
#   SUPABASE_ANON_KEY → supabase status → auth.anon_key
#   API_BASE_URL    → http://localhost:3000 (Next.js dev server)
#
# NEVER commit actual values. This file is documentation only.

